    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The word for missing poster event is:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jacub is missing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785320/extras/d5043141ea2ad630b625a287b565e67b.avif?t=1755732837\" data-has-big width=800 height=537 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped</strong> in a deranged killer\u2019s domain, you must outsmart the nightmare. The chainsaw-wielding psycho hears everything\u2014every step, every breath. Use tools, stealth, and your wits to survive. One wrong move, and the hunt begins. Will you escape, or become another gruesome trophy?<br><br><i>The madman never sleeps. He hears the creak of the floorboards, the rustle of your clothes\u2014even your heartbeat. Scavenge tools, hide in the shadows, and pray he doesn\u2019t find you first. In this hell, silence is survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Key Elements</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy <strong>reacts</strong> to any <strong>sound</strong>, so you have to be careful to be quiet, or at least hide in time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>camera</strong>, you can see better than the person who is hunting you, but you often need to <strong>recharge</strong> it or look for new batteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of a classic <strong>escape</strong>, the game will also offer side <strong>secrets</strong> or hiding places for new tools to use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will also have multiple <strong>endings</strong> depending on how much you <strong>explore</strong>, find new places or ways to defend yourself or progress further.</p></li></ul></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The word for missing poster event is:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jacub is missing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785320/extras/d5043141ea2ad630b625a287b565e67b.avif?t=1755732837\" data-has-big width=800 height=537 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped</strong> in a deranged killer\u2019s domain, you must outsmart the nightmare. The chainsaw-wielding psycho hears everything\u2014every step, every breath. Use tools, stealth, and your wits to survive. One wrong move, and the hunt begins. Will you escape, or become another gruesome trophy?<br><br><i>The madman never sleeps. He hears the creak of the floorboards, the rustle of your clothes\u2014even your heartbeat. Scavenge tools, hide in the shadows, and pray he doesn\u2019t find you first. In this hell, silence is survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Key Elements</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy <strong>reacts</strong> to any <strong>sound</strong>, so you have to be careful to be quiet, or at least hide in time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>camera</strong>, you can see better than the person who is hunting you, but you often need to <strong>recharge</strong> it or look for new batteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of a classic <strong>escape</strong>, the game will also offer side <strong>secrets</strong> or hiding places for new tools to use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will also have multiple <strong>endings</strong> depending on how much you <strong>explore</strong>, find new places or ways to defend yourself or progress further.</p></li></ul></p>",
